<title>BELGIUM: Italian ERM entry no impact on agri-monetary rates.</title>
<headline>Italian ERM entry no impact on agri-monetary rates.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union said in a statement on Sunday that the decision to allow the Italian lira back into the Exchange Rate Mechanism did not have any agri-monetary consequences.</p>
</text>
